==Notes==
*Maarselok's Azureblight has some similarities to the [[Lore:The Blight|Ash Blight]] of [[Lore:Dagoth Ur|Dagoth Ur]], both being arcane diseases linked to [[Lore:Aedra|Aedric]] forces that rot and take control of those they infect and place them under the mental control of their creator. Those blighted by Dagoth Ur were in mental contact with him, whereas the Azure Blight infected, living or dead, were described as becoming "one with Maarselok" by Selene.{{ref|name=Dreamer|[[Morrowind:Dreamer (NPC)|Dreamer]] dialogue in ''[[MW:Morrowind|Morrowind]]''}}{{ref|name=YakumH|[[MW:Yakum Hairshashishi|Yakum Hairshashishi]] on the topic of '''Soul sickness''' in ''[[MW:Morrowind|Morrowind]]''}}{{Ref|name=Dagoth|[[MW:Dagoth Ur (god)|Dagoth Ur]]'s dialogue in ''[[MW:Morrowind|Morrowind]]''}}{{Ref|name=Selene}}
